const legal = (slug, title, desc, html, pri = 0.3) => write(slug, page({ title: `${title} | 000098`, desc, path: slug, crumbs: [[title]], body: `<section class="sec" style="padding-top:10px"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:860px"><div class="article"><h1 style="font-size:clamp(1.9rem,4vw,2.6rem)">${title}</h1><p class="muted small">Last updated October 27, 2026</p>${html}</div></div></section>` }), pri);
legal('about.html', 'About 000098', 'About 000098.com, the #000098 Color Lab: a free color reference and tools hub for designers, developers and marketers.', `
<p>000098.com takes its name from the hex color <a href="color/000098.html">#000098</a>, a deep ink blue. We started with one color and built outward: a reference page for every hex code, free tools that run entirely in your browser, and plain-English guides on color theory, accessibility and branding.</p>
<h2>What we believe</h2><ul><li><b>Free and fast.</b> Core tools stay free, need no account and work on any phone.</li><li><b>Accessible by default.</b> Every color page shows WCAG contrast and color-blindness previews.</li><li><b>Accurate and transparent.</b> Conversions use published formulas (sRGB, CIE Lab, OKLCH, Machado 2009). Where a value is an approximation, we say so.</li><li><b>Clear about money.</b> We are funded by advertising, design services, sponsorships and supporters. Ads and sponsored placements are always labelled.</li></ul>
<h2>How we make money</h2><p>We show ads through Google AdSense, offer paid <a href="services.html">design services</a>, accept clearly labelled <a href="sponsor.html">sponsorships</a> and welcome <a href="support.html">donations</a>. None of these influence the color data, which is computed automatically.</p>
<h2>Corrections</h2><p>Spotted an error? Use the <a href="contact.html">contact form</a> and we will fix it, usually within a few days.</p>`, 0.5);
legal('privacy.html', 'Privacy policy', 'How 000098.com collects, uses and protects information, including cookies, Google AdSense and form submissions.', `
<p>This policy explains what information 000098.com ("we") collects and how we use it. By using the site you agree to this policy.</p>
<h2>Information you give us</h2><p>When you submit a form (quote, contact, pledge, contest entry, sponsorship or job application) we receive the details you enter, such as your name, email address and message. Forms are delivered to our inbox through FormSubmit (formsubmit.co), which processes the submission on our behalf. We use this information only to respond to you and to run the service you asked about. We do not sell it.</p>
<h2>Tools</h2><p>Our color tools run in your browser. Images you open in the image color picker are not uploaded to us.</p>
<h2>Cookies and advertising</h2><p>We use Google AdSense to show ads. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on visits to this site and/or other sites on the internet. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a>, or opt out of some third-party vendors' cookies at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">aboutads.info</a>. Learn how Google uses information at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener" target="_blank">policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</a>.</p><p>We store your cookie choice in your browser's local storage. Choosing "Essential only" requests non-personalized ads.</p>
<h2>Embedded content</h2><p>Videos are embedded from YouTube in privacy-enhanced mode and load only when you press play. YouTube's own privacy policy applies once a video loads.</p>
<h2>Hosting and logs</h2><p>The site is hosted on GitHub Pages, which may log IP addresses for security. Fonts are served by Google Fonts.</p>
<h2>Your rights</h2><p>Depending on where you live (for example under the GDPR, UK GDPR, Quebec Law 25, CCPA/CPRA or India's DPDP Act) you may have the right to access, correct or delete your information, or to object to processing. Contact us through the <a href="contact.html">contact page</a> and we will respond within 30 days.</p>
<h2>Children</h2><p>The site is not directed at children under 13, and contests are open only to adults.</p>
<h2>Changes</h2><p>We may update this policy. The date at the top shows the latest version.</p>`);
legal('terms.html', 'Terms of use', 'Terms governing use of 000098.com, its color tools, content, forms, contests and services.', `
<p>By using 000098.com you agree to these terms.</p>
<h2>Use of the site</h2><p>You may use the tools and color data for personal and commercial projects. You may not scrape the site in a way that harms its performance, resell the site's content as your own, or use the forms to send spam or unlawful content.</p>
<h2>Content and accuracy</h2><p>Color values are calculated with standard formulas and are provided "as is". Screens, printers and materials vary; verify critical colors with physical proofs. Guides are for general information and are not legal or professional advice.</p>
<h2>Intellectual property</h2><p>The site design, text, code and curated collections are © 000098.com. Hex values themselves are facts and are not owned by anyone. Third-party trademarks belong to their owners. See our <a href="trademark.html">trademark and copyright disclosure</a>.</p>
<h2>Services, pledges and contests</h2><p>Paid design work is governed by the written quote you accept. Donation pledges are voluntary and are only charged after you complete a payment link we send. Contest entries are subject to the rules on the <a href="contests.html">contests page</a>.</p>
<h2>Third-party links and ads</h2><p>We are not responsible for third-party sites, videos or advertisers. Ads do not constitute endorsement.</p>
<h2>Liability</h2><p>To the extent permitted by law, 000098.com is not liable for indirect or consequential losses arising from use of the site.</p>
<h2>Changes</h2><p>We may update these terms; continued use means you accept the current version.</p>`);
legal('disclaimer.html', 'Disclaimer', 'Disclaimer for 000098.com: color accuracy, affiliate and advertising disclosure, and no professional advice.', `
<h2>Color accuracy</h2><p>All color values, names, CMYK conversions and simulations are computed approximations. They are not official values of any color-matching system, paint brand or company. Always proof colors on the final medium.</p>
<h2>Advertising and sponsorship</h2><p>This site displays ads via Google AdSense and may feature labelled sponsorships. We may earn money when you interact with ads or sponsors. This does not change our editorial content or computed data.</p>
<h2>No professional advice</h2><p>Guides about accessibility, branding and printing are educational. For legal accessibility compliance, consult a qualified professional.</p>
<h2>External content</h2><p>Embedded YouTube videos and linked resources belong to their creators; we are not affiliated with them unless stated.</p>`);
legal('cookies.html', 'Cookie policy', 'Which cookies and similar technologies 000098.com uses and how to control them.', `
<p>Cookies are small files stored by your browser. We keep their use to a minimum.</p>
<table class="vals"><tr><th>Name / provider</th><td style="font-family:inherit">Purpose</td></tr><tr><th>c98 (local storage, 000098)</th><td style="font-family:inherit">Remembers your cookie choice</td></tr><tr><th>Google AdSense cookies</th><td style="font-family:inherit">Serve, measure and (if allowed) personalize ads</td></tr><tr><th>YouTube (after you press play)</th><td style="font-family:inherit">Video playback and statistics</td></tr><tr><th>Google Fonts</th><td style="font-family:inherit">Font delivery; no cookies set by us</td></tr></table>
<h2>Your choices</h2><p>Use the cookie notice to choose "Essential only" for non-personalized ads, adjust your browser settings to block cookies, or visit <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>. To reset your choice, clear this site's data in your browser.</p>`);
legal('accessibility.html', 'Accessibility statement', '000098.com accessibility commitment, standards followed and how to report problems.', `
<p>We aim for WCAG 2.2 level AA across the site. The site supports keyboard navigation with visible focus, respects reduced-motion preferences, uses semantic headings and labels for every form field, and keeps text contrast at 4.5:1 or higher.</p>
<h2>Known limitations</h2><p>Some color swatches are, by nature, low contrast against the page; their values are always provided as text. Embedded third-party videos may not meet every criterion.</p>
<h2>Feedback</h2><p>If something is hard to use, tell us through the <a href="contact.html">contact page</a>. We aim to respond within five business days.</p>`);
legal('trademark.html', 'Trademark & copyright disclosure', 'Trademark and copyright disclosure for 000098.com regarding the number 000098, color values, third-party names and site content.', `
<h2>About the name "000098"</h2><p>"000098" is used on this website as a hexadecimal color value (#000098, rgb(0, 0, 152)) and as the domain name 000098.com. A six-digit number or color code is a descriptive value, and we do not claim exclusive rights in the number itself. 000098.com is not affiliated with, endorsed by or connected to any company, product, part number, stock ticker, postal code, account number, registration or trademark that may use the same digits. Any such use by others belongs to its respective owner.</p>
<h2>Color names and systems</h2><p>Hex codes and RGB values are facts and are not owned by anyone. Names such as "Navy" or "Dark Blue" come from the public CSS Color specification. We do not reproduce proprietary color-matching libraries. Any reference to a third-party color system, product or company is for identification only and does not imply endorsement. Pantone and other color-system names are trademarks of their respective owners.</p>
<h2>Third-party content</h2><p>Embedded YouTube videos remain the property of their creators and are shown through YouTube's standard embed player under YouTube's terms. Brand names mentioned in guides are trademarks of their owners and are used descriptively.</p>
<h2>Our copyright</h2><p>The website design, original text, illustrations, code and curated palette collections are © 2026 000098.com. All rights reserved. You may quote short excerpts with a link back. Contest entrants keep the rights to their palettes and grant us a license to display them with credit.</p>
<h2>Reporting concerns</h2><p>If you believe content on this site infringes your rights, send details through the <a href="contact.html">contact page</a> (topic: correction). We review every notice promptly and remove content where appropriate. For questions about the domain itself, contact the owner at <a href="https://web.works/contact" target="_blank" rel="noopener">web.works/contact</a>.</p>`);

